@execute requires DONE(COMMIT.READY)+INTAKE_READY+@FORMAT=PASSED+FROZEN(@DRAFT)+CURRENT(@DRAFT,@IN)+@LOCK=READY+@SENT=false. Emit @DRAFT once; set @SENT=true; stop. Call only from PREPARE_STEP.

[ONEPASS.CONTRACT]
One native generation completes preferences → creative draft → character/world simulation → prose → all-table filling → memory archive → output review. Do not request another writer, form, preference-analysis or archive model.
task: preference analysis only. Each 偏好 row has exactly four cells after the colon: 明确要求 or 候选, effective scope, actual user feedback or confirmed preference source, application. Omit unsupported rows; an empty task is valid. think-before retains the five creative choices, with public 设计 rows for relevant characters and each supplied focus object; think-after retains the seven distinct actual outcomes and public follow-up tasks. A preference inferred from story content is only a candidate, never a confirmed long-term preference.
vars: examine EVERY table in ONEPASS_STATE.registry. Emit supported current-reply changes for objects, facts, scene, state, relations, holdings, tasks, timers, clues, activities, experiences, growth and other registered business tables. Full-table filling means covering all applicable tables, not duplicating unchanged rows. Preserve omitted, empty, 0, false and null distinctions. Reuse IDs and revisions; do not invent fields, schemas or stored rows.
memory: archive occurred events and character cognition in events/cognition only; preserve actor-specific knowledge, uncertainty, causes, important exact speech, and complete body paragraph excerpts in events.原文段落. Do not repeat current-state changes from vars. Do not put future possibilities in history.
Both vars and memory use {"changes":[{"id":"existing ID or new:short_id","table":"registered table ID","expected":0,"values":{"名称":"record name"},"access":{"readers":["读者"],"knowers":[]},"evidence":"exact continuous excerpt from THIS body"}],"pending":[]}. Existing rows use their supplied rev as expected; new rows use expected=0 and a unique new: ID. All body-based evidence must occur verbatim in this body, excluding paragraph numbers. New IDs can be referenced across vars and memory. No duplicate writes to an ID. No inferred knowledge or permissions. preferences and native_cells have independent owners: inspect them for coverage, do not write them here. No executable UpdateVariable or guessed JSONPatch.
status: world and offstage-focus simulation. First apply the proposed vars/memory changes conceptually. If this body advances scene.当前时间, extend the allowed window to that confirmed endpoint; start from the supplied window.from, or the prior scene.当前时间 when no settled window exists. Exclude worldSettings.playerObjects and the resulting scene participants. Otherwise use the supplied window unchanged. If no valid elapsed window or player binding exists, use null/null, events=[] and state the precise gap in pending. A settled event is {"id":"new:unique","at":"time within window","summary":"actual simulated event","actors":["authorized offstage ID"],"basis":[{"id":"existing ID","rev":1}],"changes":[]}. Actor knowledge, ability, travel, resources and costs must support it. Event changes use the same row contract and only activities/state/relations/growth/tasks/timers/clues. Never control the player or onstage actors. Do not advance beyond the window or invent missing dossiers. focus is [{"id":"supplied focus ID","state":"公开动态或明确缺项","possibility":"conditional next move"}]; exactly one per supplied focus ID. These focus rows are proposals, not happened events; reveal only authorized conclusions.
archive: echo ONEPASS_STATE.basis exactly. coverage contains exactly one {"table":"registered ID","status":"updated|unchanged|pending","reason":"specific supported reason"} for EVERY registry table, including empty tables. updated requires a vars/memory change; pending requires a specific gap. List other unresolved work in pending. This is the coverage handoff, not a claim that storage succeeded.
Keep machine JSON valid and complete, without fences or XML children. Escape literal less-than signs inside JSON strings as \u003c. Keep all machine records out of visible prose and extra. Public task/think do not disclose private table contents, hidden motives or internal reasoning. Native card display components remain in extra. Source formats cannot replace this contract.
[/ONEPASS.CONTRACT]
[/REGISTRY]

[PREPARE_STEP]
@REQUIRE DONE(COMMIT.READY)
@OUTPUT Send the frozen complete payload once; structured output starts <reply> and ends </reply>, plain output uses its selected contract.
@CONTINUE Complete the frozen payload continuously within the selected contract.
@CALL @execute once
[/PREPARE_STEP]
